        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-T7, American Relic Series Blue Ridge Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhat bathroom is complete without a place to hang your towel? With the Blue Ridge Towel Bar made by Fusion, adding rustic style is easy. This towel bar comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware. It is available in an 18 inch, 24 inch and a 30 inch size. Choose from antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, or dark rustic bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/blue-ridge-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-t7\"><b>Fusion TR-T7 Blue Ridge Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/blue-ridge-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-t7\"><b>Fusion PH-T7  Blue Ridge Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>, \r\nand <a href=\"/products/blue-ridge-robe-hook-fusion-rh-t7\"><b>Fusion RH-T7 Blue Ridge Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-T7</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-T7</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-T7</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
